@page "/undertale"

<div class="min-h-screen flex justify-center items-center bg-[#222222] m-0 p-0 font-['Inter',sans-serif]">
    
    <div class="w-[1080px] h-[1300px] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#000000] to-[#33184F] relative overflow-hidden mx-auto">
        
        <!-- Transparent Pattern Overlay -->
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[1080px] h-[611px] z-[1] pointer-events-none">
            <img src="/images/gradient-pattern.png" alt="Grid Pattern" class="w-full h-full block object-cover object-bottom" />
        </div>

        <!-- Navigation Bar -->
        <nav class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full flex justify-between items-center px-[40px] py-[30px] box-border z-[10]">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-[15px]">
                <div class="w-[44px] h-[33px]">
                    <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Logo" class="w-full h-full block object-contain" />
                </div>
                <div class="w-[2px] h-[24px] bg-white opacity-60"></div>
                <span class="text-[16px] font-bold text-white tracking-[1px]">VIDEO GAMES</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-[40px]">
                <a href="#" class="font-normal text-[14px] text-white no-underline transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-70">Home</a>
                <a href="#" class="font-normal text-[14px] text-white no-underline transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-70">Community</a>
                <a href="#" class="font-normal text-[14px] text-white no-underline transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-70">About us</a>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <!-- Page Content Layout -->
        <div class="relative z-[5] w-full pt-[100px] flex flex-col items-center">
            
            <!-- Banner Section -->
            <div class="w-[859px] h-[327.93px] rounded-[50px] overflow-hidden mb-[40px] animate-slide-down">
                <img src="/images/undertale-banner.png" alt="Marvel Spider-Man Banner" class="w-full h-full block object-cover" />
            </div>

            <!-- Story Summary Section -->
            <div class="relative w-[863px] h-[376px] flex mb-[50px] opacity-0 animate-fade-in delay-300">
                <!-- Outer Border Overlay -->
                <div class="absolute inset-0 border border-[#69006B] box-border pointer-events-none"></div>

                <div class="w-[237px] h-[375px] shrink-0">
                    <img src="/images/undertale-summary.png" alt="Spider-Man Story" class="w-full h-full block object-cover" />
                </div>
                <div class="grow bg-gradient-to-r from-[rgba(232,4,228,0.20)] to-[rgba(75,0,73,0.20)] p-[30px] flex flex-col box-border overflow-y-auto max-h-full custom-scrollbar">
                    <h2 class="text-[18px] font-bold text-white m-0 mb-[15px]">STORY SUMMARY</h2>
                    <p class="text-[10px] font-normal text-white leading-[1.5] m-0">
                        Eight years into his career as Spider-Man, Peter Parker finally orchestrates the arrest of crime boss Wilson Fisk. However, Fisk's removal creates a massive power vacuum in New York City's criminal underworld. This void is quickly filled by a ruthless new gang called the Inner Demons, led by the superpowered Mister Negative—secretly philanthropist Martin Li. Li is launching a violent crusade of revenge against Mayor Norman Osborn, blaming him for a tragic Oscorp experiment that killed his parents and granted him his dark powers.<br><br>While fighting this new threat, Peter struggles to balance his chaotic civilian life. He attempts to rebuild his relationship with investigative journalist Mary Jane Watson, worries about his Aunt May (who works at Li’s F.E.A.S.T. homeless shelter), and works as a dedicated research assistant for his mentor, Dr. Otto Octavius, developing advanced prosthetic limbs.<br><br>The conflict reaches a breaking point when Osborn cuts off Octavius's funding. Driven by deep-seated resentment and a degenerative neurological disease, Octavius pushes his research too far, developing a neural interface with powerful mechanical tentacles that warp his mind. Fully embracing the persona of Doctor Octopus, he orchestrates a massive prison break at the Raft supermax facility. He forms the Sinister Six (Doc Ock, Mister Negative, Electro, Vulture, Rhino, and Scorpion) and unleashes a deadly, highly contagious Oscorp bioweapon called "Devil's Breath" across Manhattan.<br><br>Spider-Man pushes himself to the absolute limit, systematically neutralizing the escaped villains and securing the antiserum. In a brutal, heartbreaking final confrontation atop Oscorp Tower, Peter defeats his former mentor. He recovers the cure but faces an agonizing moral choice: use the single existing dose to save a critically ill Aunt May, or hand it over to doctors so they can mass-produce it to save the rest of the dying city.<br><br>Peter makes the ultimate sacrifice, allowing doctors to synthesize the cure for the city while holding Aunt May as she passes away, revealing with her final words that she always knew his secret identity. The story concludes with the city healing, Peter and Mary Jane rekindling their romance, and a young Miles Morales—bitten earlier by a genetically modified Oscorp spider—revealing his newly developed spider-powers to Peter.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Gameplay Overview Section -->
            <div class="w-[863px] text-white">
                <h2 class="text-[16px] font-bold m-0 mb-[20px] uppercase opacity-0 animate-fade-in delay-500">GAMEPLAY OVERVIEW</h2>
                
                <div class="flex justify-between">
                    
                    <!-- Card 1 -->
                    <div class="w-[254px] flex flex-col opacity-0 animate-slide-down delay-600 [animation-duration:0.6s]">
                        <h3 class="text-[12px] font-bold text-[#FF5A79] m-0 mb-[10px]">Momentum-Driven Web Traversal</h3>
                        <img class="w-[254px] h-[143px] block object-cover mb-[12px]" src="/images/undertale-combat.png" alt="Swinging" />
                        <p class="text-[10px] font-normal leading-[1.5] m-0">Experience physics-based web-swinging that anchors to the city itself. Time your releases for speed or altitude, and chain web-zips and acrobatics into a seamless, high-speed flow.</p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Card 2 -->
                    <div class="w-[254px] flex flex-col opacity-0 animate-slide-down delay-800 [animation-duration:0.6s]">
                        <h3 class="text-[12px] font-bold text-[#FF5A79] m-0 mb-[10px]">Spider-Tech & Gadget Wheel</h3>
                        <img class="w-[254px] h-[143px] block object-cover mb-[12px]" src="/images/undertale-ending.png" alt="Gadgets" />
                        <p class="text-[10px] font-normal leading-[1.5] m-0">Dominate fights with Peter's custom tech. Seamlessly swap between Web Bombs, Trip Mines, and electrifying gadgets mid-combat to trap enemies, control crowds, and execute creative, high-impact combos.</p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Card 3 -->
                    <div class="w-[254px] flex flex-col opacity-0 animate-slide-down delay-1000 [animation-duration:0.6s]">
                        <h3 class="text-[12px] font-bold text-[#FF5A79] m-0 mb-[10px]">Stealth Infiltration</h3>
                        <img class="w-[254px] h-[143px] block object-cover mb-[12px]" src="/images/undertale-cozy.png" alt="Stealth" />
                        <p class="text-[10px] font-normal leading-[1.5] m-0">Cling to ceilings and perch above unsuspecting foes to execute silent takedowns. Isolate targets using your environment and clear entire enemy bases without ever triggering an alarm.</p>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>